          "headline": "House committee publishes licence records showing BIS approved more than 879,000 AI chips for Chinese buyers",
          "sources": [
            { "name": "House Foreign Affairs Committee", "url": "https://foreignaffairs.house.gov/news/press-releases/chairman-brian-mast-exercises-legislative-authority-to-publicly-release-ai-chip-license-information-for-china" },
